<quiz>
  <question type="stack">
    <name>
      <text>Income tax: tax bands and PAYE (INNODEMS)</text>
    </name>
    <questiontext format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<p>Use the monthly tax table below.</p><table style="border-collapse:collapse;text-align:left;margin:6px 0;">
<tr><th style="border:1px solid #888;padding:4px 8px;">Monthly taxable income</th><th style="border:1px solid #888;padding:4px 8px;">Rate</th></tr>
<tr><td style="border:1px solid #888;padding:4px 8px;">On the first Ksh 24,000</td><td style="border:1px solid #888;padding:4px 8px;">10%</td></tr>
<tr><td style="border:1px solid #888;padding:4px 8px;">On the next Ksh 8,333</td><td style="border:1px solid #888;padding:4px 8px;">25%</td></tr>
<tr><td style="border:1px solid #888;padding:4px 8px;">On the next Ksh 467,667</td><td style="border:1px solid #888;padding:4px 8px;">30%</td></tr>
</table>
<p>Personal relief: Ksh 2,400 per month.</p>
<p>{@nm@} has a monthly taxable income of Ksh \( {@TI@} \).</p>
<p>(a) How much of this income falls in the 30% band?</p>
<div>Ksh [[input:ans1]] [[validation:ans1]] [[feedback:prt1]]</div>
<p>(b) Calculate the gross monthly tax, to 2 decimal places.</p>
<div>Gross tax \( = \) Ksh [[input:ans2]] [[validation:ans2]] [[feedback:prt2]]</div>
<p>(c) Calculate the monthly PAYE.</p>
<div>PAYE \( = \) Ksh [[input:ans3]] [[validation:ans3]] [[feedback:prt3]]</div>]]></text>
    </questiontext>
    <generalfeedback format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<p><strong>(a)</strong> The first two bands cover \( 24{,}000 + 8{,}333 = 32{,}333 \). The rest is in the 30% band: \( {@TI@} - 32{,}333 = {@TI - 32333@} \).</p>
<p><strong>(b)</strong> Tax each band at its own rate:</p>\[
\begin{align*}
\text{First Ksh } 24{,}000 \text{ at } 10\% &= 2{,}400 \\
\text{Next Ksh } 8{,}333 \text{ at } 25\% &= 2{,}083.25 \\
\text{Remaining Ksh } {@TI - 32333@} \text{ at } 30\% &= {@r2(3/10*(TI - 32333))@} \\
\text{Gross tax} &= {@r2(gt)@}
\end{align*}
\]
<p>The 30% rate applies only to the part above Ksh 32,333, not to the whole income.</p>
<p><strong>(c)</strong> PAYE \( = {@r2(gt)@} - 2{,}400 = {@r2(gt - 2400)@} \).</p>]]></text>
    </generalfeedback>
